!Name: var-120+4n
!C p120+4n rake template
!C Matthias Merzenich, 19 Aug 2017
!C
!C To build a rake with period 120+4n:
!C 1. Move box B 93*n cells to the right.
!C 2. Separate the ships in the HWSS stream by n additional cells.
!C 3. Run the pattern until it becomes periodic.  You may need to
!C    advance box A by several generations so that the glider stream
!C    crosses the HWSS stream.
!Source: jslife-moving
!
